---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Sprig from '../components/Sprig.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services"
  description="Garden design, founder-led installation, planting and coaching, and the included lifetime Digital Support Hub — Radiant Gardens serves families across the Finger Lakes region of New York."
>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
      <h1>Garden services, from first sketch to first harvest</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Everything a busy family needs to grow real food at home — designed,
        built, planted, and supported by the founder of Radiant Gardens.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-paper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-detail" id="garden-design">
        <div class="sticky-label">
          <Sprig />
          <p class="eyebrow">01 · Design</p>
          <h2>Garden design</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="lede">
            A garden should fit your yard, your taste, and your table — not a
            catalog template.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every project starts on site. We look at how the sun moves across
            your yard, where the water goes, and how your family lives outside.
            Then we draw a garden around all of it: beds you'll love looking at,
            growing food you'll actually eat.
          </p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>On-site visit to assess sun, space, slopes, and soil</li>
            <li>
              Bed layout and planting plan matched to your family's favorite
              foods
            </li>
            <li>Varieties chosen for the Finger Lakes growing season</li>
            <li>A clear plan you approve before anything is built</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Design is included with every installation — it's how we make sure
            the garden is right before a single board is cut.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-detail" id="installation-build">
        <div class="sticky-label">
          <Sprig />
          <p class="eyebrow">02 · Build</p>
          <h2>Installation &amp; build</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="lede">
            The founder builds every garden personally — no crews, no hand-offs.
          </p>
          <p>
            On build days, quality soil and materials arrive directly at your
            home and the garden comes together efficiently: beds set level and
            square, trellises and irrigation installed and tested, soil filled
            and prepared for planting. Most gardens are built in one to two
            focused days.
          </p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Raised beds built from durable, garden-safe materials</li>
            <li>Trellises and supports fitted to your planting plan</li>
            <li>Irrigation set up and tested before we leave</li>
            <li>Quality soil delivered, placed, and prepared</li>
            <li>A walkthrough of the finished garden and your sign-off</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We leave the site tidy, the systems working, and the garden ready
            for its first seeds.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-detail" id="planting-coaching">
        <div class="sticky-label">
          <Sprig />
          <p class="eyebrow">03 · Plant &amp; coach</p>
          <h2>Planting &amp; coaching</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="lede">
            The most valuable thing we build is your confidence.
          </p>
          <p>
            After the build, we plant the first season together and walk you
            through everything: watering, weeding, trellising, harvesting, and
            what to expect week by week. You'll know what "healthy" looks like
            in your own garden — and what to do when it isn't.
          </p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>First-season planting done with you, hands in the soil</li>
            <li>A plain-language walkthrough of every system</li>
            <li>Seasonal guidance for the Finger Lakes climate</li>
            <li>Answers to anything the garden throws at you</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            The goal is simple: the garden succeeds under your hands, not ours.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-detail" id="digital-support-hub">
        <div class="sticky-label">
          <Sprig />
          <p class="eyebrow">04 · Support</p>
          <h2>Digital Support Hub</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="lede">
            Included with every garden. Free, for life.
          </p>
          <p>
            The Digital Support Hub is our promise that you're never growing
            alone. Every Radiant Gardens client gets lifetime access — no
            subscription, no expiration — to a suite of tools that keep your
            garden on track, season after season.
          </p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>A private client portal for your garden</li>
            <li>
              A personalized planting calendar tailored to your garden and our
              region
            </li>
            <li>Timely reminders for seasonal tasks, automatically</li>
            <li>
              Photo-based problem diagnosis — send a picture, get expert eyes on
              it
            </li>
            <li>
              The Radiant Community — a private group of fellow client gardeners
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We'd rather earn your referrals with decades of included support
            than nickel-and-dime you for it. That's the artisan promise.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt" id="ongoing-care">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ongoing care</p>
        <h2>A la carte, when you want it</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Beyond the included hub, clients can call on extra hands and expert
          help in any season.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid cols-2">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><Icon name="calendar" /></div>
          <h3>Seasonal check-up visits</h3>
          <p>
            A trained eye on your beds — pruning, trellising, troubleshooting,
            and a clear to-do list for the weeks ahead.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><Icon name="flask" /></div>
          <h3>Professional soil testing</h3>
          <p>
            A proper look at what's under your garden, with plain-English
            recommendations for feeding and amending your soil.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><Icon name="refresh" /></div>
          <h3>Season turn-over</h3>
          <p>
            We clear, amend, and replant your beds between seasons so the garden
            never skips a beat — spring in, fall out.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><Icon name="expand" /></div>
          <h3>Garden expansion</h3>
          <p>
            More beds, a bigger trellis, or a berry patch — designed and built
            to match the garden you already love.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <Sprig />
      <h2>Have a space in mind?</h2>
      <p>
        Radiant Gardens is in planning, with consultations expected to open in
        2026. Tell us about your yard and what you'd love to grow.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Tell us about your yard</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
